[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831364225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115521#issuecomment-3831364225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115521","id":3831364225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kXfqB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T16:40:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T16:41:10Z","body":"> Maybe it would also be good to convert the `rendering_method` string to lowercase (`Forward+` -> `forward+`, `Mobile` -> `mobile`, etc.)? In the top corner of a project it is capitalized so I think it would make sense.\r\n\r\nThis would break compatibility with existing projects that check against the reported string.\r\n\r\n(I think we should have an enum-based method for this, rather than strings as it's more error-prone, but this would need to be added in its own proposal and PR.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831364225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831411380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115521#issuecomment-3831411380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115521","id":3831411380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kXrK0","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T17:01:34Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T17:01:34Z","body":"I don't understand what problem this issue solving. Is it just to allow users to save typing an extra 2 or 3 characters?\r\n\r\nI really don't agree with having two ways of doing the same thing, but one of them is undocumented ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831411380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3844448880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115521#issuecomment-3844448880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115521","id":3844448880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lJaJw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T23:58:10Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T00:03:00Z","body":"> Is it just to allow users to save typing an extra 2 or 3 characters?\r\n\r\nYes, pretty much. To be fair, this can be worked around by creating shell aliases as follows:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nalias gdf=\"godot --rendering-method forward_plus\"\r\nalias gdm=\"godot --rendering-method mobile\"\r\nalias gdc=\"godot --rendering-method gl_compatibility\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen use `gdf --path /path/to/project` to run a project with Forward+.\r\n\r\n> I really don't agree with having two ways of doing the same thing, but one of them is undocumented\r\n\r\nI agree with this statement for anything that's exposed to API, but in my experience, the command line is an area where having multiple ways to achieve the same thing is often appreciated. It's also an area where saving a few keystrokes can go a long way in the long run (unlike writing code in general, where code is read far more often than it is written).\r\n\r\nRegardless, I'll close this if it's not desired.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3844448880/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]